---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Services & D3 Solutions | Tripower Mold Tech" description="End-to-end tooling services: Design, Development, Delivery. Precision Plastic Injection Molds, Insert & Multi-Cavity Tooling, D3 CAD/CAM/CAE Engineering." currentPage="services">
<div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- SECTION 1: HEADER & EDITORIAL HERO -->
<section class="relative w-full bg-navy-deep text-slate-100 overflow-hidden py-12 lg:py-16 px-6 lg:px-12 border-b border-rich-gold/20">
<!-- Ambient geometric background accents -->
<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20">
<div class="absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-precision-teal blur-3xl"></div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/4 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-machined-gold blur-3xl opacity-30"></div>
<!-- Fine engineering vector grid -->
<svg class="w-full h-full text-slate-700/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<defs>
<pattern height="40" id="eng-grid" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="40">
<path d="M 40 0 L 0 0 0 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.5"></path>
</pattern>
</defs>
<rect fill="url(#eng-grid)" height="100%" width="100%"></rect>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="relative w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-8 lg:gap-12">
<div class="max-w-3xl">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 bg-navy-surface text-precision-teal font-label-caps text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-full mb-4 border border-precision-teal/30 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">memory</span>
<span>D3 METHODOLOGY • END-TO-END TOOLING ECOSYSTEM</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-heading-gold text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl text-white tracking-tight font-bold mb-4">
  Comprehensive One-Stop Precision Moulding &amp; Engineering Solutions
</h1>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-200 mb-8 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
  From micro-cavity rheology analysis to high-speed Makino CNC steel machining and lifetime validation. We engineer out risk, eliminate tooling cycle bottlenecks, and ensure first-time-right repeatability.
</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
<a class="btn-cyber-blue inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 text-base sm:text-lg font-bold rounded shadow-md transition-all" href="#d3-flow">
<span>Explore D3 Workflow</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">arrow_downward</span>
</a>
<a class="btn-cyber-outline inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 text-base sm:text-lg font-bold rounded transition-all" href="#rfq-callout">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">upload_file</span>
<span>Upload 3D CAD / STEP</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Quick KPI Panel -->
<div class="w-full lg:w-96 bg-navy-surface/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-xl p-6 border border-rich-gold/30 shadow-xl">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-rich-gold/20">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-machined-gold font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">SYSTEM METRICS</span>
<span class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 relative">
<span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-precision-teal opacity-75"></span>
<span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-precision-teal"></span>
</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-3 font-data-mono">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-medium">Machining Tolerance:</span>
<span class="text-white text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold">± 0.005 mm</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-medium">First-Trial Fit Rate:</span>
<span class="text-precision-teal text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold">98.4%</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-medium">Average Cycle Reduction:</span>
<span class="text-machined-gold text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold">-22.5%</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-medium">Quality Target:</span>
<span class="text-white text-base sm:text-lg font-bold">Zero Defect Ppm</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-700/50 text-slate-300 font-label-caps text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">verified</span>
<span>VERIFIED PRECISION AUDITED METROLOGY</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- SECTION 2: INTERACTIVE D3 METHODOLOGY BREAKDOWN -->
<section class="w-full bg-background py-12 lg:py-16 px-6 lg:px-12 border-b border-rich-gold/20" id="d3-flow">
<div class="w-full">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-8 gap-4">
<div>
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyber-blue font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">
  TRIPOWER CORE ARCHITECTURE
</span>
<h2 class="font-heading-gold text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-rich-gold font-bold">
  The D3 Engineering Methodology
</h2>
</div>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-200 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
  A synchronized tripartite framework fusing digital simulation, high-velocity precision machining, and lifecycle tool commissioning under a unified accountable toolroom.
</p>
</div>
<!-- Tab Selectors for Phase Inspection -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-dark-slate rounded-xl max-w-2xl mb-8 overflow-x-auto border border-rich-gold/20" id="d3-tabs">
<button class="flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold" id="tab-btn-0" onclick="switchD3Phase(0)">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary-container text-white font-extrabold">01</span>
<span>D1: Design Phase</span>
</button>
<button class="flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold" id="tab-btn-1" onclick="switchD3Phase(1)">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-variant text-on-surface font-extrabold">02</span>
<span>D2: Development</span>
</button>
<button class="flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm sm:text-base text-rich-gold bg-navy-deep shadow-sm font-extrabold border border-rich-gold/40 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2" id="tab-btn-2" onclick="switchD3Phase(2)">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-rich-gold text-navy-deep font-extrabold">03</span>
<span>D3: Delivery &amp; Support</span>
</button>
</div>
<!-- D3 Interactive Container Cards -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch">
<!-- Content Panel -->
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between bg-dark-slate p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-rich-gold/30 shadow-lg">
<div id="d3-phase-content">
<!-- Dynamically populated or switchable view -->
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-cyber-blue font-label-caps text-xs sm:text-sm mb-3 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">view_in_ar</span>
<span id="phase-badge">PHASE 03 // COMMISSIONING &amp; LIFECYCLE SERVICE</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-heading-gold text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-rich-gold font-bold mb-3" id="phase-title">Streamlined Commissioning &amp; Single-Source Toolroom Support</h3>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-100 leading-relaxed mb-6" id="phase-desc">Tooling delivery is just the starting line. Tripower provides on-site production commissioning, spare wear components, mold refurbishment, and scheduled preventive maintenance to sustain defect-free uptime for millions of cycles.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6" id="phase-features">
      <div class="bg-navy-deep p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-rich-gold/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rich-gold text-base sm:text-lg mb-1 font-bold">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[20px]">rocket_launch</span>
          <span>Streamlined Commissioning</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">Plug-and-play production handover with certified mold validation report and setup parameters.</p>
      </div>
    
      <div class="bg-navy-deep p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-rich-gold/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rich-gold text-base sm:text-lg mb-1 font-bold">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[20px]">fact_check</span>
          <span>Long-Term Operational Reliability</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">Hardened guide pins, nickel-plated wear plates, and precision slide locks for zero-drift cycling.</p>
      </div>
    
      <div class="bg-navy-deep p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-rich-gold/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rich-gold text-base sm:text-lg mb-1 font-bold">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[20px]">build</span>
          <span>Single-Source Maintenance</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">Emergency re-tooling, cavity polishing, and modification service under one certified roof.</p>
      </div>
    
      <div class="bg-navy-deep p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-rich-gold/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-rich-gold text-base sm:text-lg mb-1 font-bold">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[20px]">recycling</span>
          <span>Sustainable Procurement</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">Scrap reduction tooling, lower runner ratios, and green tool fabrication protocols.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Bottom Metric bar for this Phase -->
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-rich-gold/20 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-slate-200 font-data-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
<span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 inline-block shadow-[0_0_8px_#10B981]"></span>DFM APPROVAL TURNAROUND: 48-72 HRS</span>
<span class="text-cyber-blue font-bold cursor-pointer hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 text-sm" onclick="switchD3Phase(1)">
  Next: Development Phase <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Visual / Spec Diagram Panel -->
<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between bg-navy-surface text-slate-100 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-rich-gold/30 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="relative z-10">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-electric-cyan uppercase tracking-wider">TECHNICAL PROCESS MATRIX</span>
<span class="font-data-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 font-semibold" id="matrix-sub">D3_PHASE_03.LIFECYCLE</span>
</div>
<!-- Inline SVG Flow Diagram -->
<div class="my-4 bg-navy-deep/90 p-4 rounded-lg border border-rich-gold/20">
<div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white font-bold mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Cycle Time Optimization Model</span>
<span class="text-machined-gold font-data-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-extrabold">-32% DEFECT RISKS</span>
</div>
<svg class="w-full h-32" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 360 110" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<!-- Curve A: Traditional Tooling -->
<path d="M10,85 C90,85 140,55 240,65 C290,70 320,50 350,55" stroke="#64748B" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="2"></path>
<!-- Curve B: Tripower D3 Optimized -->
<path d="M10,85 C70,40 160,25 240,20 C290,18 320,15 350,15" stroke="#00B4D8" stroke-width="3"></path>
<!-- Key Markers -->
<circle cx="160" cy="25" fill="#00D2FF" r="4"></circle>
<circle cx="350" cy="15" fill="#C5A059" r="4"></circle>
<!-- Baseline labels -->
<text fill="#94A3B8" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="11" x="12" y="102">CAD Ingest</text>
<text fill="#00D2FF" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="11" x="145" y="102">Moldflow Sim</text>
<text fill="#C5A059" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="11" x="280" y="102">Validated Run</text>
</svg>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mt-2 font-medium">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-1 bg-slate-500 inline-block rounded"></span> Traditional Tooling</span>
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-1 bg-precision-teal inline-block rounded"></span> Tripower D3 Engineered</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Detailed Objective Callouts -->
<div class="space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200">
<div class="flex items-start gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-machined-gold text-[18px] mt-0.5 shrink-0">check_circle</span>
<span>First Time Right design validation avoids costly re-machining cycles.</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-machined-gold text-[18px] mt-0.5 shrink-0">check_circle</span>
<span>Optimized molding machine tonnage specification to protect press longevity.</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-machined-gold text-[18px] mt-0.5 shrink-0">check_circle</span>
<span>Reduced integration complexity through standardized DME/HASCO mold bases.</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="relative z-10 mt-6 pt-4 flex items-center justify-between bg-navy-card/80 p-4 rounded-lg border border-rich-gold/20">
<span class="font-data-mono text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 font-semibold">Target Cycle Time:</span>
<span class="text-base sm:text-lg text-electric-cyan font-extrabold">≤ 18.2 Seconds</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- SECTION 3: CORE TOOLROOM SERVICES & SPECIALIZED CAPABILITIES -->
<section class="w-full bg-navy-deep py-12 lg:py-16 px-6 lg:px-12 border-b border-rich-gold/20">
<div class="w-full">
<div class="max-w-3xl mb-8">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyber-blue font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">
  MANUFACTURING PORTFOLIO
</span>
<h2 class="font-heading-gold text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-rich-gold font-bold mb-2">
  Specialized Moulding &amp; Toolroom Capabilities
</h2>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
  Complete high-precision production from micro core pins for medical disposables to heavy-duty die casting dies and wire overmolding tools.
</p>
</div>
<!-- Bento Grid Layout of 5 Core Services -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
<!-- CARD 1: Vertical Insert Molding -->
<div class="group bg-dark-slate p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl border border-rich-gold/30 shadow-md hover:border-rich-gold transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyber-blue font-bold tracking-wider">CAPABILITY // 01</span>
<span class="w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-navy-deep text-cyber-blue flex items-center justify-center border border-cyber-blue/30">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">precision_manufacturing</span>
</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-heading-gold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-rich-gold font-bold mb-2">
  Vertical Insert Molding
</h3>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-100 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
  Precision core and cavity insert technology engineered for delicate threaded brass bushings, electrical pins, and stamped micro-terminals without insert shifting or resin flash.
</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 mb-6">
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Zero-crush hydraulic core clamping</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Rotary table multi-station tool configurations</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Tolerance retention across ± 0.005mm</span>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-rich-gold/20 flex items-center justify-between text-slate-200 font-data-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold">
<span>PRESS TONNAGE: 30T – 180T</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-cyber-blue group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- CARD 2: Cable Overmolding & Connector Assemblies -->
<div class="group bg-dark-slate p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl border border-rich-gold/30 shadow-md hover:border-rich-gold transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyber-blue font-bold tracking-wider">CAPABILITY // 02</span>
<span class="w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-navy-deep text-cyber-blue flex items-center justify-center border border-cyber-blue/30">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">cable</span>
</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-heading-gold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-rich-gold font-bold mb-2">
  Cable Overmolding &amp; Connectors
</h3>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-100 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
  Custom tooling for medical-grade patient monitoring harnesses, IP67 sealed circular connectors, automotive wiring grommets, and strain-relief cable terminations.
</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 mb-6">
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Medical PVC, TPU, Santoprene &amp; TPE resin compatibility</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Pinch-free wire shut-off tooling design</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Rigid inner pre-molds with soft-touch exterior jacket</span>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-rich-gold/20 flex items-center justify-between text-slate-200 font-data-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold">
<span>APPLICATIONS: MEDICAL &amp; AUTO</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-cyber-blue group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- CARD 3: High-Precision Injection Molds -->
<div class="group bg-dark-slate p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl border border-rich-gold/30 shadow-md hover:border-rich-gold transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyber-blue font-bold tracking-wider">CAPABILITY // 03</span>
<span class="w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-navy-deep text-cyber-blue flex items-center justify-center border border-cyber-blue/30">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">layers</span>
</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-heading-gold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-rich-gold font-bold mb-2">
  Precision Plastic Injection Molds
</h3>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-100 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
  Multi-cavity production tooling built with hardened premium steels (Bohler, ASSAB, NAK80). Capable of multi-million cycle operational life with low maintenance frequency.
</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 mb-6">
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Hot runner systems (Yudo, Mold-Masters, Husky)</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Sub-gate, valve gate, and pinpoint gate tooling</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>High-cavitation tooling (up to 32 cavities)</span>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-rich-gold/20 flex items-center justify-between text-slate-200 font-data-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold">
<span>SPI CLASS: 101 &amp; 102 TOOLING</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-cyber-blue group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- CARD 4: Die Casting & Compression Moulding Tooling -->
<div class="group bg-dark-slate p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-xl border border-rich-gold/30 shadow-md hover:border-rich-gold transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyber-blue font-bold tracking-wider">CAPABILITY // 04</span>
<span class="w-11 h-11 rounded-lg bg-navy-deep text-cyber-blue flex items-center justify-center border border-cyber-blue/30">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">view_in_ar</span>
</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-heading-gold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-rich-gold font-bold mb-2">
  Die Casting &amp; Compression Moulds
</h3>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-100 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
  Thermal-fatigue resistant tooling for aluminum &amp; zinc high-pressure die casting, alongside precision thermoset compression dies engineered for extreme pressure resilience.
</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 mb-6">
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>H13 Premium / Dievar steel vacuum hardening</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Thermal regulation oil circuit cross-drilling</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[18px]">check</span>
<span>Complex hydraulic core pull configurations</span>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-rich-gold/20 flex items-center justify-between text-slate-200 font-data-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold">
<span>RESISTANCE: 52-54 HRC HARDENED</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-cyber-blue group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
</div>
